  "text": "garden-builder garden-boat-controls\n\nHaving the ability to do something.\n\nWould like to have or do something.\n\nThe greatest amount, or nearly all.\n\nJourneys from one place to another.\n\n“Could you leave a little earlier?”\n\nKeep something from harm or damage.\n\nThe land on each side of the river.\n\nSelected from the things available.\n\nMade a small, light knocking sound.\n\nM47 176q29 6 57 0M49 72h43m-28-7h37\n\nStory directions and other controls\n\nKept something from harm or damage.\n\nPip walks to the outdoor worktable.\n\nSmall containers used for drinking.\n\nHad a particular meaning or result.\n\nRelying on someone to do something.\n\nBefore now or sooner than expected.\n\nA small pool of water on a surface.\n\nMoving toward or away from a place.\n\nM-27-31q19 9 39 0M-15-15h19m-16 8H0\n\nChanges that make something better.\n\nDivide something with a sharp edge.\n\nDiscuss another way to include Mara\n\nIn the space separating two things.\n\nThe land along the side of a river.\n\nThe secured section stays in place.\n\nMara gives Pip a copy of her story.\n\nYour repair progress is still here.\n\nAt or in the place being described.\n\nA copy of Mara’s story for Grandma.\n\nEarlier than another time or event.\n\nResponded to someone or something.\n\nChoose a shorter part for feedback\n\nFinds or uses a particular amount.\n\nPutting a seed or plant into soil.\n\nGive someone information in words.\n\nIdentifies or asks about a person.\n\nWhat happens because of an action.\n\nMaking sounds that show amusement.\n\nA written message sent to someone.\n\nDirect your eyes toward something.\n\nMake something easier for someone.\n\nDiscovers or comes upon something.\n\nA small, light knock or its sound.\n\nm153 170 14 2m22 2 12-2m-28 6 13 1\n\nEvery time that something happens.\n\nM-70 10q-5-27 1-48l29 2q4 24 0 46Z\n\nPlant the seed with Grandma first.",
